  "_approach": "Kick-dropout build: bar 1 is the full groove, bar 2 removes the kick and lets a 16th rim ramp, a rising low conga and stepped claps take over, then everything stops for two 16ths and a single stacked hit (rim + clap + conga) lands on the last step. The 'silence gap' before an Afro-tech drop. (re-voiced for the Vermona DRM1 MKIII's 8 channels)",
